### 3.2 Component Identification

```bash
# Identify reusable components
"$PWCLI" eval "JSON.stringify({
  buttons: Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('button, .btn, [class*=button]')).map(b => ({
    text: b.textContent.trim(),
    classes: b.className,
    styles: getComputedStyle(b).cssText
  })),
  inputs: Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('input, textarea, select')).map(i => ({
    type: i.type || i.tagName.toLowerCase(),
    classes: i.className,
    placeholder: i.placeholder
  })),
  cards: Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('[class*=card], [class*=item], [class*=product]')).length,
  navItems: Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('nav a, header a')).length
})"
```

### 3.3 Responsive Breakpoints

```bash
# Check media queries
"$PWCLI" eval "Array.from(document.styleSheets).flatMap(sheet => {
  try {
    return Array.from(sheet.cssRules || []).filter(r => r.type === CSSRule.MEDIA_RULE).map(r => ({
      media: r.conditionText,
      cssText: r.cssText
    }));
  } catch {
    return [];
  }
})"

# Test responsive behavior
"$PWCLI" resize 320 568   # Small mobile
"$PWCLI" eval "document.body.clientWidth"
"$PWCLI" resize 768 1024  # Tablet
"$PWCLI" eval "document.body.clientWidth"
"$PWCLI" resize 1920 1080 # Desktop
```

## Phase 4: Cloning

### 4.1 Project Structure

```
clone-project/
├── index.html              # Main HTML file
├── css/
│   ├── main.css           # Main styles
│   ├── components.css     # Component styles
│   └── responsive.css     # Media queries
├── js/
│   ├── main.js            # Main JavaScript
│   ├── components.js      # Component logic
│   └── utils.js           # Utility functions
├── assets/
│   ├── images/            # Downloaded images
│   ├── fonts/             # Downloaded fonts
│   └── icons/             # Icons
├── components/            # Reusable HTML components
│   ├── header.html
│   ├── footer.html
│   ├── nav.html
│   └── modal.html
└── README.md
```

