## Advanced: SPA/Framework Clone

### React/Vue Clone Strategy

```javascript
// Detect component structure
"$PWCLI" eval "JSON.stringify({
  components: Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('[class*=Component], [class*=component]')).map(c => ({
    name: c.className,
    children: c.children.length,
    hasState: !!c.getAttribute('data-state')
  })),
  routes: window.__INITIAL_STATE__?.router?.routes || []
})"
```

### API Integration Clone

```javascript
// Detect API calls
"$PWCLI" eval "JSON.stringify({
  apiEndpoints: Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('[data-endpoint], [data-api]')).map(el => ({
    endpoint: el.dataset.endpoint || el.dataset.api,
    method: el.dataset.method || 'GET'
  })),
  graphql: !!document.querySelector('script[type=\"graphql\"]')
})"
```

